meta {
  name: EC11 TAT resumes on the next working day
  seq: 12
}

script:pre-request {
  if (!bru.getVar("baseUrl")) bru.setVar("baseUrl", "http://localhost:3000/api/v1");
}

docs {
  Scenario: resume and CONTINUE (not restart) the next working day.
Expected: tat_is_running goes true again and tat_net_minutes CONTINUES from the saved value (not 0). It keeps accumulating each working day until approve.
Status: VERIFIED by unit test.

  Run 00 Base Setup first (same session) so the shared vars are available.
}
